1
00:00:00,662 --> 00:00:02,632
(Leonard:)What?

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,800
It's a Pokémon reference.

3
00:00:04,799 --> 00:00:06,499
(Woman:)I don't know what that means.

4
00:00:06,501 --> 00:00:08,631
(Sheldon:)Well, we gave it a shot.

5
00:00:09,302 --> 00:00:12,042
(Sheldon:)How about you?

6
00:00:12,039 --> 00:00:15,239
(Older woman:)I'm married,
and I'm her grandmother.

7
00:00:15,243 --> 00:00:18,073
(Sheldon:)Ah, what might have been.

8
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:22,149
(Sheldon:)And you, give my regards
to Barnum and Bailey.

9
00:00:25,285 --> 00:00:28,625
(Bernadette:)Stuart took that rejection
like a pro.

10
00:00:28,623 --> 00:00:31,493
(Penny:)Well, he knew
he was on the breast cam.

11
00:00:33,393 --> 00:00:36,133
I don't have much practice
turning men down.

12
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,660
(Amy:)It wasn't so much fun.

13
00:00:37,665 --> 00:00:38,995
(Bernadette:)Oh, you get used to it.

14
00:00:38,999 --> 00:00:41,269
(Bernadette:)Some guys you have
to turn down over and over.

15
00:00:41,268 --> 00:00:43,968
(Penny:)And sometimes
we marry them anyway.

16
00:00:43,971 --> 00:00:45,971
(phone chimes)

17
00:00:45,973 --> 00:00:48,203
(Amy(Phone text sound):)Huh.

18
00:00:48,209 --> 00:00:50,439
(Amy(Phone text sound):)Well, this is weird.

19
00:00:50,444 --> 00:00:53,514
(Leonard:)What?
Barry Kripke just asked me out.

20
00:00:53,514 --> 00:00:54,884
(gasps)
BERNADETTE: Oh.

21
00:00:54,882 --> 00:00:57,252
(Bernadette:)Look at you...
two guys in one day!

22
00:00:57,251 --> 00:01:02,021
(Penny:)I told you things would change
if you plucked your eyebrows!

